    "The school budget figure is the operating-budget warrant article voted at the annual Pembroke School District meeting (traditional meeting, not SB2). It excludes separate warrant articles. The meeting in March of year Y adopts the budget for fiscal year Y+1 (July to June), which is taxed partly in the year-Y rate and partly in the year-Y+1 rate.",
    "The town budget figure is the municipal operating budget article voted at the March town meeting. It excludes special warrant articles.",
    "Rates are set by NH DRA each fall. Total = municipal + county + state education + local education.",
    "A revaluation took effect in 2024 ($794.5M assessed in 2023 vs $1.233B in 2024), so rates before and after 2024 are not directly comparable as tax effort.",
    "source_type values: DRA_primary = NH DRA statewide rate table; town_report / town_report_DRA_sheet = Pembroke Annual Report (which reproduces the DRA calculation); secondary_cites_DRA = CNHRPC master plan table citing DRA; sau53_* = SAU 53 published documents; derived = computed from a cited document."
